ob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0657.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0657.json","https://github.com/stg-tud/cveenhance/blob/6476e73d87cdc9cf610342ef15d131432ab41588/Annotations/Wollny/CVE-2000-0657.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2xfg-fq6q-8vvj/GHSA-2xfg-fq6q-8vvj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0657.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--63c9f350-62a5-48bd-8935-8f461e7be081.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1504/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0794.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0512","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0512.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0656","title":"AnalogX Proxy 缓冲区溢出远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AnalogX Proxy 4.04 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 FTP 协议发送超长的 USER 命令，触发目标代理服务中的缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞源于软件对用户输入长度缺乏有效校验，影响 AnalogX Proxy 4.04 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0656"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-25T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12.183","remediation":"升级到 AnalogX Proxy 4.05 或更高版本（可从官方下载页面 analogx.com/contents/download/network/proxy.htm 获取）。由于 AnalogX 产品已停止维护且不再更新，建议作为长期方案迁移至仍在维护的代理服务器（如 Squid、HAProxy 或 Nginx）以替代 AnalogX Proxy。临时缓解措施可在防火墙或代理配置中限制 FTP 代理服务的访问来源 IP，仅允许信任网段连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0360.html","http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/proxy.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1504","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20099","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0656.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0656","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0656.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0656.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xfg8-c4cc-3fg2/GHSA-xfg8-c4cc-3fg2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0656.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--227f18ce-c4a2-47d9-93e9-35e551fcd06f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0512.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0510","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0510.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0655","title":"Netscape Communicator JPEG 注释堆溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.73 及更早版本在处理 JPEG 图像注释字段时存在堆溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含非法长度字段（值为 1）的 JPEG 注释内容的恶意图片，诱使用户访问包含该图片的网页或邮件，触发堆内存破坏，导致拒绝服务或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 4.x 全系列版本，危害等级中等，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0655"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-07-25T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12.003","remediation":"升级至 Netscape Communicator 4.74 及以上版本即可修复此漏洞。由于 Netscape Communicator 系列已停止维护且存在大量未修复漏洞，强烈建议彻底停止使用该软件，迁移至 Mozilla Firefox、Google Chrome 等现代浏览器以避免后续安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0456.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0116.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_60.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-046.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1503","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3Flist%3D1%26msg%3D200007242356.DAA01274%40false.com","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-August/000016.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20098","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0655.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0655","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0655.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0655.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5cwq-wmjx-47pq/GHSA-5cwq-wmjx-47pq.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-130.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--49d59ab6-ccc8-4409-b3d0-f83557dac489.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0510.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0510.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0510.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0503","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0503.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0652","title":"IBM Websphere Application Server 可执行脚本源代码泄露漏洞","description":"IBM WebSphere Application Server 2.0/3.0/3.0.2.1 版本中存在源代码泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标服务器发送包含 \"/servlet/file\" 字符串的特制 URL，直接调用默认的 InvokerServlet，从而读取可执行 Web 文件（如 JSP、Servlet 等）的源代码。该漏洞可能导致敏感业务逻辑泄露，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0652"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11.633","remediation":"升级 IBM WebSphere Application Server 至 3.5 及以上版本，或修改 servlet 配置文件禁用默认的 InvokerServlet（移除或注释 servlet 映射中的 /servlet/* 路径），并在 Web 服务器层限制对 /servlet/ 路径的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0342.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1500","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5012","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20097","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0652.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0652","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0652.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0652.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b877d0b06ff3c980d2ef6a3eb41e4e2bf2ab8ff9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-78c2-6wr9-gc88/GHSA-78c2-6wr9-gc88.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/IBM%20WebSphere%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E5%8F%AF%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8Cweb%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%BA%90%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2000-0652).html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0652.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--221cf026-9cb3-4632-89dd-05eeb0547ab7.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--221cf026-9cb3-4632-89dd-05eeb0547ab7.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0503.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0503.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0503.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0784","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0784.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0646","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 2.41 路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"WFTPD 和 WFTPD Pro 2.41 存在信息泄露漏洞。当文件处于传输过程中时，远程未经认证的攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务器发送 STATUS（STAT）命令，获取服务器上文件的实际路径名。该漏洞源于服务器在处理 STAT 命令时未对路径信息进行过滤限制，导致文件系统真实路径被泄露。攻击者可利用此漏洞收集服务器目录结构信息，为后续渗透攻击提供线索。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0646"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10.887","remediation":"升级 WFTPD 至 2.41 以上版本（如 2.42 RC 或更高），该版本修复了 STAT 命令泄露真实路径的问题。如无法升级，可在 WFTPD 配置中禁用 STAT 命令或限制可执行该命令的用户组，同时在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 服务端口（默认 21）的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信地址连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1506","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0646.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0646","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0646.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0646.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5da0a5f6cef8a27d290daf0d2c65fed1d1f621b9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2w42-wj39-8g7h/GHSA-2w42-wj39-8g7h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--44bc0445-af22-4a29-8c93-6d7278bf916d.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0646.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0784.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0525","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0525.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0671","title":"Roxen WebServer 空字符注入信息泄露漏洞","description":"Roxen WebServer 2.0.69 之前版本存在访问控制绕过漏洞，远程攻击者通过在 URL 中插入空字节（%00）即可绕过服务器访问限制，遍历并列出任意目录内容，以及读取服务器端源代码文件（如 .asp、.cgi 等脚本源码）。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，主要影响早期版本 Roxen WebServer 2.0.x 部署环境。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0671"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:14.087","remediation":"立即将 Roxen WebServer 升级至 2.0.69 或更高版本，该版本修复了空字节注入漏洞。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx/Apache），过滤包含 `%00` 的 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0307.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0321.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1510","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4965","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20104","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea704212a9ed8366f550e49ed4e382e3803a0ba0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0671","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0671.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8473d6777e627a0bbc745aac735e80a8c8aa5c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mmrv-3fq5-g8jf/GHSA-mmrv-3fq5-g8jf.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/roxen_percent.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/web-misc.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0525.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0498","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0498.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0647","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD MLST命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 2.41 及之前版本在处理 MLST 命令时存在空指针引用缺陷。未经认证的远程攻击者可在未登录 FTP 服务器的情况下直接发送特制的 MLST 命令，导致服务器进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WFTPD 2.4.1、2.4.1 RC11、2.34、2.40 等多个版本，攻击复杂度低，无需任何身份认证即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0647"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11.020","remediation":"将 WFTPD 升级至 2.42 或更高版本，厂商已修复 MLST 命令未经验证即可执行的问题，要求用户完成登录认证后方可处理 MLST 指令。若无法升级，可在防火墙上限制 TCP 端口 21 仅允许受信任 IP 段访问，同时在 WFTPD 配置中启用 IP 访问控制列表，作为临时缓解措施。长期建议迁移至仍在维护的 FTP 服务器软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1506","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20102","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0647.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0647","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0647.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0647.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5da0a5f6cef8a27d290daf0d2c65fed1d1f621b9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rg84-mjm4-xc43/GHSA-rg84-mjm4-xc43.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/wftp_241_dos.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0647.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--be184c6b-4e5e-479e-9672-fb63dd6d0ce0.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0498.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0496","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0496.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0645","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Texas Imperial Software 开发的 WFTPD 及 WFTPD Pro 2.41 版本在处理 RESTART (REST) 命令时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务发送特制的 REST 命令，结合 STOU、STOR 或 APPE 等存储指令，将数据写入文件末尾之外的位置或写入不存在的文件，导致 FTP 服务崩溃或异常终止，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 6.4，影响 WFTPD 2.4.1/2.4.1 Rc11/2.34/2.40 等多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0645"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10.753","remediation":"该产品厂商已停止运营，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即停用 WFTPD 2.41 及所有更早版本，替换为积极维护的 FTP 服务器软件（如 vsftpd 3.0.5+、ProFTPD 1.3.8+）。如无法立即替换，可在防火墙或 TCP Wrappers 层面限制只允许可信 IP 访问 FTP 端口（21），并禁用匿名用户写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1506","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20101","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0645.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0645","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0645.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0645.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d34115c5df8a79b3a76d7097ef910b9992c9ee85/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-24r6-29j2-hrjv/GHSA-24r6-29j2-hrjv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e3ebd4ef-ac1a-4303-bfd4-e428085b5411.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0645.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0496.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0495","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0495.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0644","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Texas Imperial Software 出品的 WFTPD 及 WFTPD Pro 2.41 及更早版本（包括 2.34、2.40、2.4.1、2.4.1 RC11）存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于 FTP 服务在处理命令时的竞争条件缺陷：当 LIST 命令尚未执行完毕时，远程攻击者可未经身份认证向目标 FTP 服务器发送 STAT 命令，导致服务器进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。攻击者无需任何权限即可发起攻击，影响服务的可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0644"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10.607","remediation":"升级 WFTPD 至 2.42 及以上版本，该版本已修复并发 STAT/LIST 命令导致的拒绝服务问题。如无法升级，可考虑在防火墙或 WAF 层面限制 FTP 控制连接中的 STAT 命令，或迁移至更现代且持续维护的 FTP 服务器软件（如 FileZilla Server）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0295.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1477","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1506","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5003","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20100","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0644.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0644","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0644.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0644.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d34115c5df8a79b3a76d7097ef910b9992c9ee85/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c4qc-qrx8-9prp/GHSA-c4qc-qrx8-9prp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0644.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d23c5bcf-bd8e-4bd8-bb92-e476ce438a4c.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0495.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1400","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0621","title":"Microsoft Outlook 和 Outlook Express 远程文件读取漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 和 Outlook Express 在处理HTML格式电子邮件时存在\"缓存绕过\"漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的畸形HTML邮件，利用客户端将文件存储在缓存目录之外的机制，绕过浏览器缓存安全限制，从而读取客户端系统上的敏感文件。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Outlook 98/2000 以及 Outlook Express 4.0x/5.0x 等旧版本邮件客户端。攻击者无需预先认证或交互，仅需受害者打开或预览恶意HTML邮件即可触发。CVSS评分为7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0621"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07.677","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2000 年 7 月安全更新（MS00-046），该补丁修复 Outlook 98、Outlook 2000、Outlook Express 4.x 及 5.x 的缓存绕过漏洞。也可将 Internet Explorer 升级至 5.01 Service Pack 1 或 5.5 版本（除 Windows 2000 外），其中 Outlook Express 5.5 已包含不受影响的组件。如无法立即安装补丁，可临时在 Outlook 和 Outlook Express 中将邮件阅读格式切换为纯文本，禁用 HTML 邮件渲染以防止恶意邮件利用缓存绕过机制读取本地文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-14.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1501","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-046","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5013","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2000/CVE-2000-0621.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0621.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0621","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e90b2f048f8d5dc2c03ffbfc9a042a055738ffe6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0621.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0621.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vvh2-vwv7-8grx/GHSA-vvh2-vwv7-8grx.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cd6abe9c-4755-4bef-8a51-73f63abb74c9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0621.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0621.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0505","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0505.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0653","title":"Microsoft Outlook Express 持久邮件浏览器链接漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook Express 存在持久邮件浏览器链接漏洞（Persistent Mail-Browser Link）。攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本的 HTML 邮件发送给目标用户，当用户使用预览窗格打开该邮件时，脚本会创建一个与 Outlook Express 窗口持久关联的浏览器窗口，使得该窗口能够持续读取后续在预览窗格中显示的所有邮件内容，并通过 HTTP 将窃取的邮件文本转发给攻击者。该漏洞影响 Outlook Express 4.x 和 5.x 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，需用户开启预览窗格并打开恶意邮件方可触发。Microsoft 已发布 MS00-045 安全公告提供修复补丁，建议升级至 Outlook Express 5.5 或安装对应补丁程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0653"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11.760","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-045 提供的补丁，或将 Outlook Express 升级至 5.5 版本（通过默认安装 Internet Explorer 5.01 Service Pack 1 或 IE 5.5）。临时缓解措施：在 Outlook Express 中禁用预览窗格（视图→布局→取消勾选\"显示预览窗格\"），或将 HTML 邮件分配到受限制站点区域并禁用 Active Scripting。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1502","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-045","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19738","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0653.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0653.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0653","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0653.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0653.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b877d0b06ff3c980d2ef6a3eb41e4e2bf2ab8ff9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5jwc-8539-rgx6/GHSA-5jwc-8539-rgx6.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0653.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8dde87b5-9128-4719-966c-3ebfb58f06bd.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0505.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0505.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0505.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0481","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0481.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0624","title":"NullSoft Winamp 2.64 M3U播放列表缓冲区溢出","description":"Winamp 是 NullSoft 公司开发的一款流行媒体播放器，其 2.64 及更早版本在处理 M3U 播放列表文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当播放列表文件中包含超长的 #EXTINF: 扩展字段时，Winamp 在解析该字段时未对输入长度进行充分校验，导致发生缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向受害者发送特制的 M3U 播放列表文件（例如通过电子邮件附件、即时消息或网页链接诱使用户打开），在用户使用 Winamp 打开该恶意播放列表时触发溢出，进而执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Winamp 2.64 及以下所有版本，由于 Winamp 在当时被广泛使用，潜在影响范围较大。用户应升级到修复版本以避免遭受攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0624"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08.083","remediation":"建议立即将 NullSoft Winamp 升级至 2.81 或更高版本，该版本已修复 M3U 播放列表中 #EXTINF 扩展字段的缓冲区溢出问题。无法升级时，应避免打开来源不明的 .m3u 播放列表文件，并在防火墙层面禁止 Winamp 进程接收外部网络连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0289.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1496","http://www.winamp.com/getwinamp/newfeatures.jhtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4956","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20094","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5b3647aa8630e92d52def237a668e1c7c212a696/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0624.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0624","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/035716a784b26bf707cbf0b8f17696c9c2e71cb8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0624.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/48bcd43923f8bb2f197ede4a17570cc3bd71fd9e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0624.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m85g-37m6-fpww/GHSA-m85g-37m6-fpww.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0624.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0624.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2c1c1db6-4f49-492d-b096-ed972bb5c981.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0481.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0745","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0745.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0619","title":"TopLayer AppSwitch 2500.0 ICMP Packet 拒绝服务漏洞 漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Top Layer AppSwitch 2500 应用交付控制器在处理 ICMP 数据包时存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标设备发送畸形构造的 ICMP 数据包触发服务中断。该漏洞影响运行 AppSwitch 2500 固件的设备，攻击条件仅需目标在网络层可达且无需任何凭据。攻击成功后将导致设备可用性受损，合法用户可能无法正常访问受保护的后端服务。厂商已发布安全更新修复此问题，建议用户升级固件版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0619"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-19T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07.427","remediation":"立即在网络边界防火墙处过滤所有来源异常的 ICMP 包（如 oversized ICMP、fragmented ICMP），在 TopLayer AppSwitch 2500 上关闭不必要的 ICMP 类型（如 echo-reply、timestamp-reply），降低被利用发起拒绝服务攻击的风险。由于厂商 TopLayer 已于 2000 年代初期被 Foundry Networks 收购且该设备年代久远，建议将 AppSwitch 2500 替换为受支持的现代交换机以彻底消除此风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q2/0680.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q2/0921.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1258","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7364","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0619.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0619","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0619.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6a16668a1632a04fd23488d1308b95bb656fd69/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0619.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xfmh-wgwr-479f/GHSA-xfmh-wgwr-479f.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0619.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0619.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2473a005-538a-403f-902e-87fb8b51d47f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0745.toml"}]